<li><a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/view-pg-locks.html">pg_locks</a> and <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/explicit-locking.html">Explicit locking</a>: requested and granted modes, transaction ownership and the conflict between ordinary reads and ACCESS EXCLUSIVE.</li>
